  "description": "O’Mahony Property are delighted to bring to the market this well-located two-bedroom apartment at 15 Steamboat Quay, enjoying wonderful views over the River Shannon.\n\nSituated in the heart of Limerick City, this property offers an excellent combination of city-centre convenience and attractive riverside surroundings. The apartment is within easy walking distance of an extensive range of shops, cafés, restaurants, bars and other amenities, while also providing excellent access to the city’s main road network and surrounding employment hubs.\n\nThe accommodation is well presented and comprises a bright open-plan kitchen and living area, two bedrooms and a main bathroom. A private balcony overlooking the Shannon further enhances the appeal of the property and provides a pleasant outdoor space to relax and enjoy the views.\n\nThe property also benefits from designated private parking, a particularly valuable feature for city-centre living.\n\nWhether you are seeking a convenient city base, a first-time purchase or an investment opportunity, 15 Steamboat Quay represents an excellent opportunity in a highly sought-after location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the location, views and accommodation on offer.\n\nGet in touch with O’Mahony Property today to arrange a viewing\n\n________________________________________________\n\nThese Particulars and terms are the responsibility of all prospective purchasers/lessees to independently verify and satisfy themselves regarding the accuracy of the information provided. O’Mahony Property shall not be liable for any loss or expenses incurred in visiting the property if it is found unsuitable, sold, or withdrawn. Please be advised that we have not conducted any tests on the apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services mentioned in this advertisement. Interested parties are responsible for conducting their own investigation to assess the working order and condition of these items. All measurements provided are approximate, and the photographs included are for guidance purposes only.",
